 * Output-parameters are only applied if the current code-block exits its
   branch at the 'proper' point.

 * GASP preparsing code does not track the current filename.

 * The CLIP operands are now present but not properly validated.
   (pinned as EXPECTED_FAIL in test/integration/test_clip_validation.cpp)

   ---------- Fixed entries kept for reference ----------

 * (FIXED) Specifying .init_vf with a register-range used to result in an
   argument-error.  The tokenizer now accepts ranges; regression-pinned by
   test/integration/test_init_vf_range.cpp.

 * (FIXED) The register-allocator used to be strictly line-based and miss
   reuse of values across loop iterations (e.g. 'move test,test' with no
   subsequent dependency).  Loop back-edges now extend the live range of
   pre-loop aliases through the loop body (commit 303c528).

 * (FIXED) The expression evaluator used to output a float where a hex
   value was required for LOI immediates.  The 'raw' modifier and the
   matching IEEE-754 hex emission path were added in commit bc41a56.
